@startuml
title Nexus Deploy - Application Deployment Sequence

actor Developer

participant "Git Provider" as Git
participant "Nginx" as Nginx
participant "API / Webhook Service" as API
participant "Pipeline Service" as Pipeline
participant "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Redis" as Redis
participant "Pipeline Orchestrator" as Orchestrator
participant "RabbitMQ" as Queue
participant "Worker" as Worker
participant "Docker Sandbox" as Docker
participant "Artifact Manager" as Artifact
participant "Container Registry" as Registry
participant "Deployment Manager" as Deployment
participant "Deployment Platform" as Platform
participant "Health Checker" as Health
participant "Prometheus" as Prometheus
participant "Notification Service" as Notify

Developer -> Git : Push code

Git -> Nginx : Webhook event

Nginx -> API : Forward webhook

API -> API : Validate signature

API -> Redis : Check idempotency

Redis --> API : Event not processed

API -> Pipeline : Identify pipeline

Pipeline -> DB : Load pipeline configuration

DB --> Pipeline : Pipeline definition

Pipeline -> Orchestrator : Trigger pipeline

Orchestrator -> DB : Create pipeline run

Orchestrator -> Queue : Enqueue job

Queue -> Worker : Deliver job

Worker -> Docker : Create isolated sandbox

Worker -> Git : Fetch source

Git --> Worker : Source code

Worker -> Docker : Execute build

Docker --> Worker : Build result

alt Build failed

    Worker -> DB : Store failed run
    Worker -> Notify : Send failure notification
    Notify --> Developer : Build failed

else Build successful

    Worker -> Docker : Run tests

    alt Tests failed

        Worker -> DB : Store test failure
        Worker -> Notify : Send failure notification
        Notify --> Developer : Tests failed

    else Tests passed

        Worker -> Docker : Build container image

        Docker -> Registry : Push image

        Registry --> Docker : Image stored

        Worker -> Artifact : Store artifacts

        Artifact -> DB : Store artifact metadata

        Worker -> Deployment : Request deployment

        Deployment -> Platform : Deploy image

        Platform --> Deployment : Deployment result

        Deployment -> Health : Run health checks

        Health -> Platform : Check application

        Platform --> Health : Health status

        alt Healthy

            Health -> DB : Mark deployment successful
            Health -> Prometheus : Publish metrics
            Notify -> Developer : Deployment successful

        else Unhealthy

            Health -> Deployment : Trigger rollback

            Deployment -> Platform : Restore previous release

            Platform --> Deployment : Rollback complete

            Deployment -> DB : Mark rolled back

            Deployment -> Notify : Send rollback notification

            Notify --> Developer : Deployment rolled back

        end

    end

end
@enduml